        "answer": {
          "short": "$a_{11}=50\\tfrac12$",
          "worked": "AP where $a=10\\tfrac12$, $d=4$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}a_{11}&=10\\tfrac12+(11-1)(4)\\\\a_{11}&=10\\tfrac12+10(4)\\\\a_{11}&=50\\tfrac12\\end{align*}$$",
